{"manifest":"{\"format\":1,\"version\":\"5.0.7\",\"notes\":\"5.0.7 — HOTFIX (Kovan beta 0.1.2): League Asistanı artık her hatta yalnız o hattın şampiyonlarını öneriyor (gerçek hat verisi; Bard üst hatta çıkmıyor; ban, canlı maç ve hat tahmini de buna bağlı). Derece amblemleri büyütüldü (boş kenarlar kırpılıyor). Windows'ta ve gerçek League istemcisiyle denenmedi.\",\"minLoader\":1,\"created\":\"2026-11-05T09:08:57.689Z\",\"files\":{\"StatScan.html\":{\"sha256\":\"e6f1f6ffa34de84794d1b1a2fef96154d02795e49487fe7dcec34d2528b43125\",\"size\":1399401},\"desktop/app.js\":{\"sha256\":\"53dbdbb7ea410ef4efc8bdd6f6ba3f5343ef85708771128b48afb74756468c51\",\"size\":12999},\"desktop/assets/icon.ico\":{\"sha256\":\"b0d623d0b828bcf7603ee02ac7b5cc8e9b27b13fdb5c3eff548f2cb7b7963543\",\"size\":372526},\"desktop/assets/icon.png\":{\"sha256\":\"6ce7c330fdcf2d8785ba7ea16895cc376bfbb22b4ee061da7a0692002c3ca376\",\"size\":99730},\"desktop/host.js\":{\"sha256\":\"fdf7062e1aebdb3c886f294200cb0fd80c79b3720150bd47f5dab98e745389de\",\"size\":307310},\"desktop/preload.js\":{\"sha256\":\"8d4a80475b8c80663d247722a236a3531064d67cab7b366ff6526a858292ef6a\",\"size\":8060},\"dyn/collector.ps1\":{\"sha256\":\"3329b8cdf5257002b1f0fbe10bbc0da8ed09103d33ff67618ab8d897a61b71cb\",\"size\":39356},\"dyn/README-dinamik.md\":{\"sha256\":\"da91e62f58ce365cdec59c1ec4b689c8cf0412e742c1ea728d8ba09394485b0d\",\"size\":7201},\"dyn/statscan-dyn.js\":{\"sha256\":\"bfc3f746e061f22ae93f36968e0952f2162470b39534a2d3f8c6489795b0f883\",\"size\":115235}}}","sig":"0hsCt+DVY7YUiPHa7cZV9096RP4+aXO/bAihjuSTwcwx0yVek/HaaIKDtY5lIWY0r+1mQiNRy84D6ufnbjimAg==","data":{"StatScan.html":"","desktop/app.js":"","desktop/assets/icon.ico":"","desktop/assets/icon.png":"","desktop/host.js":"","desktop/preload.js":"","dyn/collector.ps1":"","dyn/README-dinamik.md":"","dyn/statscan-dyn.js":""}}